Ye_2025,Ye_2025,10.1016/j.coi.2025.102649,165,"In this phase 2 trial, we applied MaaT013, an off-the-shelf readily available product to treat grade III-IV SR GI aGVHD. The day 28 GI ORR rate was 38% in 24 prospectively enrolled patients. Compared with single donors, MaaT013 is characterized by higher microbial richness and reduced variability across batches.",NA,NA
