Sporrer_2015,Sporrer_2015,10.1007/s40778-014-0006-9,61,"Jenq RR, Ubeda C, Taur Y, Menezes CC, Khanin R, Dudakov JA, et al. Regulation of intestinal inflammation by microbiota following allogeneic bone marrow transplantation. J Exp Med. 2012;209(5):903–11. Jenq et al. used murine models of GvHD to describe the impact of the microbiome on GvHD outcome and GvHD-related pathology. With antibiotic pretreatment, they induced shifts in gut microbiome composition and loss of diversity, which translated into increased pathology. Supplemental data on human stool specimens after allogeneic SCT confirm microbiome shifts in relation to human GvHD.",NA,NA
